<title>PORTUGAL: Yield falls on Portugal 10-yr bonds.</title>
<headline>Yield falls on Portugal 10-yr bonds.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is the result of the Portuguese Treasury's auction of 10 billion escudos of 10-year fixed-rate bonds (OT).</p>
<p>    ISSUER: Republic of Portugal   MATURITY:  Feb 23 2006</p>
<p>COUPON: 9.50 pct  AVERAGE ACCEPTED YIELD: 6.869 pct</p>
<p>AMOUNT PLACED: 10 billion escudos</p>
<p>HIGHEST ACCEPTED YIELD: 6.87</p>
<p>LOWEST ACCEPTED YIELD: 6.84</p>
<p>PAYMENT FREQUENCY: ANNUAL</p>
<p>NOTES: The issue is fungible. The auction takes to 247.67 billion escudos the total amount of the bonds issued.</p>
</text>
